{
  "name": "Agency OS 09 \u00b7 Competitor Radar",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Competitor Radar\nEvery **Wednesday** it re-reads each competitor URL in the **Competitors** tab, which onboarding seeds automatically.\n- Diffs the page text against last week's snapshot sentence by sentence, and tracks price points.\n- Meaningful changes go to **Brain (competitor-profiling)**. It classifies the change (pricing, positioning, offer...), explains what it signals, and recommends counter-moves for your client.\n- Only medium and high significance changes reach Slack. Snapshots update every run.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      },
